{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet February, the magical and forgetful explorer. She finds herself in a broken realm with the sole task to save everyone and make it out in time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529080/extras/d3e7d0059d4e8adc3cad8d3391a9ee4d.avif?t=1770299025\" width=762 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This combat-free, rogue-like side scroller focuses on speed and character movement. As February, you'll explore procedurally generated worlds, and some will even have a twist. Collect resources to influence the next world in the hope of rescuing everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock to explore procedurally generated worlds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources and use them to upgrade world generation. The choices you make will determine how the successive worlds are generated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade movement controls and physics, but beware of the additional challenges this could create in the next world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly continue a completed run as an endless mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: the art found on this page and in screenshots is not final. All artwork and screenshots are subject to change before release.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529080?t=1770299025","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529080?t=1770299025","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529080/ebb11be5eab9edfd43dbb9c5b396eb654946970c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770299025","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529080/ebb11b